  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "It is a classroom. Teacher Kim says, \"Close your book.\" Lily closes her book. Leo closes his book. \"Get a red crayon.\" They get one.",
      "Teacher Kim has a picture. It is a cat. The cat is small and brown. \"Is it a dog?\" \"Make a tick or a cross.\" Lily makes a cross. She looks at Teacher Kim. \"Is it correct?\" asks Lily.",
      "\"Yes, it is correct!\" \"Thumbs up!\" \"Is it a cat?\" Leo makes a tick. \"Correct!\" Leo smiles. He is happy. Lily shows a thumbs up."
    ],
    "summary": "Teacher Kim shows a picture of a cat. Lily and Leo close their books, take red crayons, and make a cross or a tick.",
